        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "The children of Israel again did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight, when Ehud was dead.",
      "ko": "에훗의 죽은 후에 이스라엘 자손이 또 여호와의 목전에 악을 행하매",
      "source_text_hash": "d6c324a234786b74b38155f8cc78cfa8513ebad636ca23d2c686c97d413e6a77",
      "translation_text_hash": "f1fa3acb37c7f4ef4c1b1ca4bc06a0db133906d8a38028a7b5c27cd3d358ab0f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "에훗의 죽은 후에 이스라엘 자손이 또 여호와의 목전에 악을 행하매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f1fa3acb37c7f4ef4c1b1ca4bc06a0db133906d8a38028a7b5c27cd3d358ab0f"
      ]
