      ],
      "en": "The hand of the children of Israel prevailed more and more against Jabin the king of Canaan, until they had destroyed Jabin king of Canaan.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손의 손이 가나안 왕 야빈을 점점 더 이기어서 마침내 가나안 왕 야빈을 진멸하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "89685fdecd064a7c13c6dc1fe4392934a6de9f3e78b129f7d7d59edb701db470",
      "translation_text_hash": "e24ab5a1c50f6a7a424b2b593d0886dccea50854a9389ee7bb8e4b9ab84f4ffe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
